WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.352 --> 00:00:20.674
Mandy sat on a step in front of the Parthenon.

2
00:00:21.815 --> 00:00:24.116
Socrates' students gathered around.

3
00:00:25.416 --> 00:00:27.798
Mandy listened as Socrates spoke.

4
00:00:29.078 --> 00:00:31.480
He was glad Mandy was sitting with them.

5
00:00:33.308 --> 00:00:37.771
Socrates was saying that girls should go to school, just like boys.

6
00:00:38.852 --> 00:00:42.114
Suddenly Mandy remembered the photo in her pocket.

7
00:00:42.795 --> 00:00:43.695
She took it out.

8
00:00:43.715 --> 00:00:46.477
"It's changed colors!"

9
00:00:47.138 --> 00:00:48.799
she said a bit too loudly.

10
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:54.663
In the picture, the helmet on the statue was glowing blue.

11
00:00:54.683 --> 00:00:56.364
"What is that?"

12
00:00:57.005 --> 00:00:59.046
said a man sitting next to Mandy.

13
00:00:59.887 --> 00:01:01.428
He was pointing at the photo.

14
00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:05.322
"Nothing," she said nervously.

15
00:01:07.164 --> 00:01:10.627
The students gathered around to look at the strange picture.

16
00:01:11.828 --> 00:01:14.050
One of the students held out his hand.

17
00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.572
"Give me that," he said.

18
00:01:16.592 --> 00:01:20.115
"No, I won't," Mandy replied.

19
00:01:20.135 --> 00:01:22.517
"I can't get home without it."

20
00:01:24.478 --> 00:01:26.620
The student tried to grab the photo.

21
00:01:27.221 --> 00:01:28.261
Mandy stood up.

22
00:01:29.542 --> 00:01:31.144
She tried to hide the photo.

23
00:01:31.848 --> 00:01:34.590
But more students noticed the glowing helmet.

24
00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:37.291
"Gods above!"

25
00:01:38.112 --> 00:01:38.932
someone said.

26
00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:40.713
People started shouting.

27
00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:43.995
Their eyes grew wide with fear.

28
00:01:44.575 --> 00:01:48.057
Because of the fuss, Socrates came over to Mandy.

29
00:01:48.077 --> 00:01:50.479
"Who are you?"

30
00:01:51.299 --> 00:01:51.880
he asked.

31
00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:54.601
Mandy did not answer.

32
00:01:55.362 --> 00:01:59.224
She turned and ran up the rest of the steps into the Parthenon.

33
00:02:01.852 --> 00:02:05.554
Back at the gymnasium, Vinnie was thinking about Mandy.

34
00:02:05.574 --> 00:02:10.637
"Jason," he said, "I think I should find my sister.

35
00:02:11.517 --> 00:02:13.538
She's probably wondering where I am."

36
00:02:13.558 --> 00:02:20.802
"Sister?" the other boys laughed loudly.

37
00:02:20.822 --> 00:02:22.943
"Isn't she at home cooking?"

38
00:02:24.024 --> 00:02:27.546
The boys started teasing Vinnie, but Jason did not.

39
00:02:27.566 --> 00:02:31.408
"Do not say such things about our sisters!"

40
00:02:32.208 --> 00:02:33.029
Jason yelled.

41
00:02:34.009 --> 00:02:36.411
He and Vinnie walked out of the gymnasium.

42
00:02:36.431 --> 00:02:40.394
"You are close to your sister," he said to Vinnie.

43
00:02:40.414 --> 00:02:42.215
"Like me and Callia."

44
00:02:42.235 --> 00:02:47.198
"Yes, I'm worried about her," said Vinnie.

45
00:02:47.218 --> 00:02:51.802
"Maybe Mandy went back to my house," Jason replied.

46
00:02:53.162 --> 00:02:55.324
The boys ran back to Jason's house.

47
00:02:55.984 --> 00:02:58.026
Callia was in her room, weaving.

48
00:03:01.132 --> 00:03:02.253
"Callia, is Mandy here?"

49
00:03:02.953 --> 00:03:03.974
Jason asked.

50
00:03:04.995 --> 00:03:06.295
Callia shook her head.

51
00:03:06.315 --> 00:03:08.917
"Weren't you going to the Parthenon?"

52
00:03:09.478 --> 00:03:10.058
she asked.

53
00:03:10.078 --> 00:03:11.739
"That's right!

54
00:03:12.099 --> 00:03:13.340
Mandy must be there!"

55
00:03:14.061 --> 00:03:14.861
Vinnie shouted.

56
00:03:16.822 --> 00:03:19.804
Waving good-bye, the boys ran out of the house.

57
00:03:20.325 --> 00:03:22.286
They ran through the agora.

58
00:03:23.207 --> 00:03:25.388
They climbed the steps to the Acropolis.

59
00:03:25.408 --> 00:03:29.631
"Jason!" gasped Vinnie.

60
00:03:29.651 --> 00:03:30.732
"Wait for me!"

61
00:03:33.756 --> 00:03:35.978
Jason really was a fast runner.

62
00:03:36.678 --> 00:03:38.319
Vinnie could hardly keep up.

63
00:03:39.981 --> 00:03:42.462
"Sorry, Vinnie," grinned Jason.

64
00:03:42.482 --> 00:03:44.144
"I'll slow down."

65
00:03:45.505 --> 00:03:47.926
The boys made it to the top of the hill.

66
00:03:50.128 --> 00:03:52.550
Vinnie took a deep breath and looked down.

67
00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:54.711
The view was amazing.

68
00:03:54.731 --> 00:04:01.296
"You can see all of Athens from here," Vinnie remarked.

69
00:04:02.117 --> 00:04:03.559
Jason nodded proudly.

70
00:04:03.579 --> 00:04:07.005
"Yes, it truly is a beautiful city.

71
00:04:07.546 --> 00:04:09.630
Come, Vinnie, let's find Mandy."
